    covers: "xtask/tests/verify_doc.rs, read against the real specs in the tree - (1) every doc-assets/ src a spec PRESCRIBES (escaped, inside a template block, which is what separates a prescription from the spec own head) resolves to doc-assets/components/ from the folder that spec artifact lives in; (2) design-flow.html spells doc.rs BUNDLE verbatim, because check_assets matches the src string literally; (3) component-design.html prescribes the Babel tag, without which the text/babel mount never runs and every spec-* host renders empty. All three red against the tip before the corrections (17 passed; 3 failed), green after (20 passed)."
