    waived: "No user-facing surface, no route and no rendered state - the WU changes two T1 process specs and adds a test over them. The skeleton was still proven end to end by hand and the transcript is in the result: a throwaway component design file built from the old head is refused by check-render.mjs (\"a live component design loads no specimens.bundle.js\"), the same file built from the corrected head reports 2 mounts. The epic e2e is W10 and covers no part of this WU."
